msgid "A refusal means the page does not exist, is in the trash, or your account may not edit it; wp-mylinks/list-pages shows the pages you can edit."
msgstr ""

#: includes/agent/class-wp-mylinks-agent-abilities.php:806
msgid "The site owner chooses whether changes to a published, scheduled or private page wait for approval. If they do, wp-mylinks/update-page answers with status awaiting_approval, visitors keep seeing the live page, and wp-mylinks/get-page shows the change under proposal. While a proposal waits, later changes build on it and wait with it: the version to send is the proposal's, and row positions count the proposal's rows. A page taken out of public view keeps waiting for approval until a person saves it in the WordPress editor. Only a person can approve or discard a proposal, in WordPress."
msgstr ""

#: includes/agent/class-wp-mylinks-agent-abilities.php:808
msgid "Changes a MyLinks page. Call wp-mylinks/get-page first and send its version as expected_version: if the page changed since, nothing is written and you are told to read it again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/agent/class-wp-mylinks-agent-abilities.php:809
msgid "Send only what should change. A list field such as links or additional-socials takes a mode. update changes only the fields you send on the rows you name: {\"links\": {\"mode\": \"update\", \"rows\": [{\"index\": 0, \"title\": \"My shop\"}]}}. append adds rows after the existing ones: {\"links\": {\"mode\": \"append\", \"rows\": [{\"row-type\": \"link\", \"title\": \"Blog\", \"url\": \"https://example.com/blog\"}]}}. replace makes your list the only rows, in your order, and from carries an existing row over with all its settings: {\"links\": {\"mode\": \"replace\", \"rows\": [{\"from\": 1}, {\"from\": 0, \"title\": \"Now first\"}, {\"title\": \"New\", \"url\": \"https://example.com\"}]}}."
msgstr ""

#: includes/agent/class-wp-mylinks-agent-abilities.php:810
msgid "index and from count rows from 0, while error messages call the rows you sent Row 1, Row 2 and so on. A row with has_inactive_settings holds settings that are not available right now: keep it with update or from, because a replace that would delete it is refused."
msgstr ""

#: includes/agent/class-wp-mylinks-agent-abilities.php:811
msgid "HTML is always cleaned, even for administrators, and custom scripts are out of reach. Images are Media Library attachment IDs from wp-mylinks/list-media-images; 0 clears an image. Uploading and deleting are not available."
msgstr ""

#: includes/agent/class-wp-mylinks-agent-abilities.php:817
